# head/adult/marks_lined: the Lined mark (age): a crease at each outer eye corner and from the nose to the mouth
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). An overlay at the face rows every head type keeps. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role marks lined
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 1
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -3 -10
|r........r
|..........
|...r...r..

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -10 -10
|r.
|..
|.r

view L key rest origin -4 -10
|.r
|..
|r.
